    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d20">

                <pb facs="0028" n="14" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg14"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710 Conference W And PW/1–2245: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Beaulac</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-01-22T16:00:00-04:00">January 22, 1945—4
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 11:58 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>54. Your circular January 19, midnight. I have not encouraged Chiriani<anchor
                        n="26" xml:id="d20-f1"/> to submit specific requests for economic aid during
                    the conference at Mexico. Paraguay may be expected to introduce or support
                    measures capable of continental application which would be helpful to Paraguay
                    such as assistance in construction of Pan American Highway, additional gasoline
                    quotas for highways newly constructed with American financial aid and assistance
                    to immigrants. These topics were mentioned on pages 3 and 4 of my despatch 440,
                    January 9.<anchor n="27" xml:id="d20-f2"/>
                </p>
                <p>If other countries are being encouraged to present specific requests at Mexico
                    City I should like to be promptly informed so that Paraguay may have the
                    opportunity of doing the same.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaulac</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d20-f1" n="26" xml:id="d20-f1-content">
                <p>Horacio Chiriani, Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
